  "review_text": "I just made these and 😍😋!!!! Changes- used a whole cup of white sugar and 1/2 c of brown (because it's what I had) and 1/2 c less flour after reading some other reviews, and added a tiny dash of cinnamon. They are phenomenal! Crispy edges and gooey center. My husband works from home and he can't stop coming out of his office and trying them!!!! HUGE hit and will be my go to. Thank you!!"
